{"id":"n62063-1-17","stage":1,"title":"눕다 · 躺","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62063-1-17-1","ko":"누워서 책을 보면 자세가 안 좋아진단다.","zh":"躺着看书的话，姿势可不好哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누워서","meaning":"躺","explanation":"눕다：躺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"눕다","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62063","senseId":"1","lemma":"눕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자세가","meaning":"姿势，姿态","explanation":"자세：姿势，姿态；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자세","audio":"/audio/8cc096f62a2aeac2c96a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24780","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아진단다.","meaning":"那样就好了；表示成为前面表达的状态。；表示引用。","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；하다：表示引用。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aaed3d6f391054fe","term":"눕다","zh":"躺","audio":"/audio/aaed3d6f391054fec9e8.mp3","entryId":"62063","definition":"人或动物将背部或肋部贴附在某处而横躺下。","pronunciation":["눕ː따"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8cc096f62a2aeac2","term":"자세","zh":"姿势，姿态","audio":"/audio/8cc096f62a2aeac2c96a.mp3","entryId":"24780","definition":"活动或支撑身体的态度。","pronunciation":["자세"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a41ebdb4488f8e3635af.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62063-1-17-2","ko":"네. 앉아서 볼게요.","zh":"好的，那我坐着看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아서","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"t